Well, I can't do meter and rhyme worth warm spit,
so I'll try haiku instead.

> A certain something I have for you
> That wil melt you down to hobbit stew.

Sting's my guardian,
Filthy orc, of your brethren
We will make quick work.

Slime of green, cloner
Beast, if you attack this hobbit
On my fire you'll feast.

> Find some sense and fear my might;
> I'll suck the blood from you tonight.

Cape'd crusader
Dungeon puffball, your defense
In ruin I'll make fall.

Vlad in his tower
K.I.S.S.I.N.G
Will never get me.

Count of undeadness
Hides in a tower, soon will fall
To my rocky shower.

> So silly of you to come so near;
> You'll be my next meal, I fear.

My trapper zapper
Will call your bluff, toast you'll be
In one great "zot-poof".

Lurk below or lurk
Above, my magic missiles
You will find lack love.

> Do you dare to read me cursed?
> Though thick-skulled; you'll still feel worse.

Scroll of earth, careful,
First, I will bless you, second
You will build my lair.

> Pardon me, sir, but I think you should
> Stop constantly kicking at that wood.

Hive of the killer,
Bee in flight, my axe and me
Topple trees tonight.

Flight of the bumble
Bee, song of the axe, your home
Falls in forty whacks.

> Are you daft, or are you blind?
> Know that you'll soon be out of your mind.

One mold, two mold, three
Mold, more, double-check your food
>From the fungus store.

> Won't you come closer, my dear?
> Let me kill you, with a touch, right here.

Too many monsters,
With fingers of death, fungus
Violet, assist.

Innocent lichen
Green on a rock, I can't move,
Others do your work.

> I may be blind, but I still can be
> Quite a blast if you hit me.

Dart or arrow, knife
Or rock, if my pet's near you
Fido gets a shock.

Light of yellow, sphere
Of shock, melee with many is
A deadly mistake.

> Watch your step! You might meet your end
> If [in] your hand is your avian friend.

Many a slip, twixt
The corpse and the pit, don't walk
While cockatricing.

Dancing mathilda,
Prance with cockatrice, you'll be
A rock if you trip.

> I welcome you in
> To my homely place;
> Though you'll soon be floating
> Upon your face.

Juiblex, your swamp,
In frozen state I will cross
While you I slaughter.

Eels in the water
Kraken near shore, into your
Lair, dead evermore.

